ption": "【Live2D】ハニカノ さぁ純粋な恋をしよう 橘スミレ編", "short_introduction": "【Live2D】ハニカノ さぁ純粋な恋をしよう 橘スミレ編", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ311745.html", "site_id": "home", "fetched_at": 1794960926}